# Prove your courage! (Q613) for a level 75 Varka ally of level 3 holding the level 3 alliance mark: Ashas Varka Durai
# offers the quest and the player takes it. Hekaton's death gives the head (cond 2, the middle sound first), and Ashas trades it
# for the Feather of Valor and 10000 experience, ending the quest. Holding the feather he is no longer offered it. The head
# going to every ally of the killer's party is in varka_party_test.go. Expectations replay the reference trace of this
# scenario.
